Package: meetranslate
Version: 0.1.1
Section: user/utilities
Priority: optional
Architecture: armel
Depends: python (>= 2.6), python-pyside.qtcore, python-pyside.qtgui, python-pyside.qtdeclarative, qt-components, libqt4-network
Maintainer: smyhu <smyhu@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: MeeTranslate: translator for the Nokia N9 (by Claude with smyhu)
 Online translation with Google Translate and MyMemory, dictionary for
 single words, offline WikDict dictionaries (Wiktionary) and reading
 the translation aloud. Polish, English, German, Spanish, Italian and
 French user interface.
